---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller invokes end()
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator AND caller is not projectAdmin
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator OR projectAdmin
    q_check_ended --> q_error_already: hasEnded == true
    q_error_already --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_set_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_set_ended --> q_set_times: hasEnded = true
    q_set_times --> q_calc_refund: endTime = block.timestamp
    q_calc_refund --> q_emit: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleEnded(endTime, refundEndTime)

    note right of q_set_times
        INV-001: hasEnded transitions from false to true exactly once
        INV-002: endTime is set exactly once when end() succeeds
        INV-003: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds (no overflow)
        INV-004: No further investments accepted after hasEnded = true
    end note
